    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>k</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>k</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">n</mi></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>β</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> equals"
  },
